{"evt":"summary_set","id":"note:note-mqq5a6voihw","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","summary":"The native code onboarder feature is BUILD-COMPLETE on orch/feature/native-code-onboarder (head 13848f4f), productizing the benchmarked cmm-onboard pipeline as a first-party capability — no external tool at query time. Phases delivered + merged to the feature: (1) AST extractor (lib/code-extract, @babel/parser, CJS+ESM, 1048 symbols on own lib/, 0 parse failures); (1b) pluggable backend registry + web-tree-sitter WASM backends for Python/Go/Rust/Java/C/C++ (49/49 tests, ~7.1MB vendored grammars); (2) dedicated code_node overlay layer (own map mirroring knowledge_nodes, excluded from dup-judge/dashboard/learner) + POST /overlay/code-nodes/bulk (batched embeds, skips dup-guard, one epoch) + DIRECT-RAG retrieval in /search (tier 'code', ORCH_CODE_NODE_WEIGHT) — note_nodes byte-unchanged; isolated-daemon e2e ingested 1158 symbols → 0.474 raw-locator recall@k=10 (tight-k ranking ceiling, all symbols retrievable at k=50); (3+4) delete-by-file with a reload-surviving code_node_removed tombstone, lastIndexedCommit watermark (overlay.config + GET/POST /config), git-diff incremental sync (lib/code-extract/sync.js: replace added/modified, remove deleted, handle renames, advance watermark; must read the watermark back from the daemon before diffing) and the onboard-code CLI (scripts/onboard-code.js --repo --workspace [--sync]). Also integrated: the inject-concurrency batch bulk-ingest path was merged into this feature (the code_node bulk write depends on it). Tests across the feature: code-extract 35, multilang 49, code-node-bulk 26, code-sync-unit 53, code-sync-e2e 12, plus graph-store 119 + bulk-ingest 31 green. REMAINING (user-gated, NOT done autonomously): feature->main merge + daemon restart to make it live, and a deploy of the inject-concurrency refactor it carries. Follow-ups noted: ~7.1MB grammar footprint (cpp 4.5MB) trimmable; the 0.474 tight-k ceiling suggests a smarter fetch/rerank would lift end-to-end recall toward the benchmark's 0.583.","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-23T04:42:05.040Z"}
